The only fixture addressed to more than one person, and the only one with a Cc.

Reply-all is the whole reason it exists: it is the one action whose result depends
on the shape of the original's recipients, and against every other fixture here it
derives a single address — which is exactly the case that worked while a To holding
two of them, and a Cc holding one, were both drawn wrong (docs/contacts.md §4).

The sender is a fourth address, so the derived To is "board, tc" and the derived Cc
is "rene": three pills across two fields, with Alice's own address removed from both.
